source:
At 3 or more stacks, increases ATK by <color="#f20c68">30%</color>;
At 5 or more stacks, increases CRIT Rate by <color="#f20c68">20%</color>;
At 7 or more stacks, increases CRIT DMG by <color="#f20c68">50%</color>;
At 9 or more stacks, increases Final DMG by <color="#f20c68">30%</color>. Stacks up to 11 times.

